{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1298,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db6ce7d403ced0b76623927",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『U.A.F.』のおかげで、\r\nスポーツの秋も大盛り上がり！\r\nアタシのモチベもギュンギュンだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04980c63324263e167ac9821a3ca8c00ca6f4bb0e7f0cacc69db12df98c26e97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26db4770690cc3429ed05d4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…あの特設スケートリンク、\r\nいつまでだっけ？ニッコニコで滑る\r\nユキちゃん、可愛かったなぁ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bfccb2a87e6976229cb96d340126a5542c6fea64153d132d8219c5d0858917c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1746261af3b16b933b71f7e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装ね！実はタイシンと\r\nハヤヒデが隠れてるんだー！\r\nえへへ、どこでしょーうかっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4285c3b107b0c047b0a6a2a6114781fd736670a1279d2dcfc2b290aa7b020029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553db6cba9218de26c24598f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宣誓ッ！アタシ、ウイニング\r\nチケットは！これからもずっと！\r\nキミとがんばることを、誓います！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36aaa4002098f87cdb4027c9a578221e1ef5eb2e785732217b7443aa8da3c4f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a609457cade7ae5acb4a71c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好──我要上咯──！喔喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5dfacddde08e54e5a60f4670f5fa1ca9fe5703444f8ac47e5b9c4507bc8856c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ea85927871f73b7dfee97d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力だぁー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "513e4bbf18c960d813b40ce05ce2d75179961534e52f14305991d53074a51c84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a457f3bffd81254c1bf24126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿──无论是\r\n什么训练安排都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c3576c4c8cae1f71ec328123c6deb666b1a67599967861a0f5ecad982f1ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e56bc5289f1fb07554a28956",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒啦──！\r\n训练的时间到了──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68f9536198af5397fd41cca63a22ce3062ca7219d628929f32f14eacb2e52b4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e561be4a7e80ada64aa8a98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都已经准备好了哦！\r\n今天也麻烦你了哦，训练员！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d44a77ddc9f98414a1bb7b040f0917f872ad28594461f9dc56eb46ef2027d41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87a5729156b813b2cf551134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我也要\r\n让你好好看到我的进步！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7a84f8065552449c48360520224143b3a4c2f1ee7990e5e9714461eda182112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbebaf2ce23d613064ab31d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了有一天可以\r\n一起抓住胜利的奖券！\r\n现在得要好好努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0d4b0860eb1731b6bec34329d6f89e13a9a1f63446a111185890b986f3fbd31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959e071e60e84c1e8e83e40e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果没有训练员帮忙，\r\n我的梦想是绝对无法实现的。\r\n今后也要一直……哇哈！好害羞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "176db41b32a3c9300c2dcc23d40d3b788aaad156e3d2569aef4e01122d609cfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f9f9baead86c9666dcf005",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像这样在一旁看，\r\n就会觉得大家都很努力。\r\n我也不能输──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da4a39e807a163c54426212a48d9092c6175941eda627e3843fff232763696dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4c9f351655521cd6894791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Ready to start！\r\n耶嘿嘿，我在用无线电通讯喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c932578ddaf4a42404e44327a8069eafc55d854cbfa48fa0ca1d57516b9b1dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef0adc8a9bc367a725058c6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力训练一定有意义！\r\n我会加油的────！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e5fa897ef3bd57caa9631eda30fdb46ee967d34f4494ea895ad726c5d2aa20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f14c8547f819d6e1a591d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油喔喔喔────！！\r\n为了实现梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd0fad72381754222e00209e2db2080d3412723f000f12e3b84639bdaf515735",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e57edb15ca7abd89efae43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力训练的模样，\r\n或许也能为他人带来梦想！对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2104d7d8f9a0a3405db4b60bbc16001e586a30cb9643658669d85bb0948fa81a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baaf4a268e5edb14bde9a132",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论再遥远，都要紧盯梦想\r\n专心致志地向前跑！\r\n一切努力都不会白费的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "216706a14bec4ed9e69c590aa6c2bcba8b53235df7bfd9c2b6aa61ee4d026b1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5bfc19fa24c0e1d2acd0a83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使遇上险峻的高山，\r\n只要越过去就好！\r\n我现在是这么认为的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4be5eeac9bd2f087b9583863bd82016231cdcee92357d57e667c7bb4060912",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0806438bc183d853f2f33084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有办法为训练员送上胜利吗？\r\n不，别怀疑，\r\n我绝对会送达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d6ea39c92a76943af1a6a373840a4d024f60457503b3bc586b46b405edfa1d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8acfb8ffde764b1c35d46a8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシの背中が、誰かの夢、\r\n誰かの憧れになるんだ。\r\n…よし！やるぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1739e583a2bcea41fd9576bfd868f2ed4e11b2810e98b0b92d2bf44eb01ac8b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd5581be5323218c34ee7e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの先頭に立つ気持ちで！\r\n全！力！トレーニング！だぁーー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "727b9163d18bb079c80abc6f812963f1517e291d133a04476a148e285c5b53f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a1f64f5a7b3b405865f16b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子よし！リボンよし！全部よし！\r\n準備OK！やるぞやるぞやるぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f125b3c3921c7b4ecd97160d91d97545a1ab6001bd775af1395978ea46cd04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceabdb591a5360c712e44b29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も全力全身で！\r\nトレーニングすることを\r\n誓いまぁーーーーっす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d22c352dafbbbe2cd1ce643fdc4659d976cfdb1a91a1301feecaa69cd0917568",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8de2c79903420887dea919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぉおおおおお！\r\nBNWの飾りをつけてるんだ！\r\n負けない！負けないぞぉーー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9676d5fb6aa7ddd023d1b65dd73707aa1c454bc3091e7f336530cb5fca22594c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d82b388751075e102b6c4ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あの日アタシが見た夢を、\r\n今度はアタシが！\r\n見せられるように！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c145412feca68dc3c900c835c4d0c08d00b8b04fb0069da468a61d97dffea4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617b902f8490bd65d88f73b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんを\r\n表彰台までエスコート！\r\n…できるように！がんばるぞーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e838b76391988d3cc98b9e1a791b38f71991af618d30b9855a69d932fc1298a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4daa571943322bda8811019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起抓住的胜利的奖券……\r\n绝对不会放手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a780bae8d5d0eeeb31cf9b270da50454ca2e114160250f68d4899b35f369e638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b021c72c5a8308e2e5f3f55d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员～！真的很谢谢你啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b31d47a3ad702592a8f86f8bd6ef49b8b263c67485603872404958a4bc1f60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a79a27e0cbca65faabbd5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，以后还要\r\n继续跟我一起分送梦想喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed8d25fa765f79c90d8b828bd20f065bd66c759baf99192a863ddc77c2682e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33997acf67647a69b66c544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真希望我的梦想也能传递给他人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2526d6b86150958d07fff62b393d57e3e57aa1528c1b02404dfe5f900b69ed2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:767d90561f50d1a4429467b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どれーなーざんへの恩返し、\r\nごごに誓うよぉ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "002a4ec8abb97f428d2d6f3cfb5fa0811da746abd9d9ada405901911f00fa2b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59126bf1082acef250f49443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スポーツって、サイコーだぁー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f3012fef91a49e0b4d3b2e86a832dbc702ac2c91eefb21b3bc860e24a7a5b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d44cc1fee27878a2f1fb7687",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我还在成长的巅峰期嘛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a114fc50d879e0057e984240c1ed989bf865190ff7e45b73c62cf2589de94b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:607e39f531db90eb8edf3a09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要超越自己！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dc473e1733d05b06ee336ea8a15c4a4eeb917a93732ab95a5085b72423eb15b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be378fd8a395ecf781cce2cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是！我叫胜利奖券！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d68570ee58f7d5e325c254de4f15ae5d0cd45d827682e16cee9fbb5eaecfec33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:140133edd9af03644996ffcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包在我身上吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c75e19267337e657c0661f3a0de531e71e03160c23466faf840d3db5b85641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc58d8716f6ac0545f415eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会全力支持的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9d13ff2480b752b685eb945d6256b503715803fe7c2c3a09c79ce6405b70b9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269b45fbd017e96616b444ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "职业等级提──升！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5b766eca505d8d7bb217cc0e86742e6b3e3ecc81861734b13b3c858c6cfece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c327b9e32a66a301c366b74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要成为这职业的大师！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f9236a5b7b661e17144879bc8dd6b60f75fae19979a54d27d6b4eb98e02119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e2678ec853b267c02a616b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被托付的意志……\r\n我一定会成功送达目的地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "829955a0c3904f59fb3728b784be4f81e7867fa6f26eee6c7727725db78b1929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d77ae44ce41f694d2b7f0acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是送货员胜利奖券！\r\n出发去递送梦想吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04572e2a192bc9cdd606f252846c7a01fc7302e3fac90ab3adbc4bba70104b33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae7d19393fb38ba2621ec78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誓いを！力に！するぞー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aaf78c8867aef99a51956eccc05a5d37d28a94717eaf3ebaf5570617abb5d94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d45bde78709f08ac0db9f952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界記録だって出しちゃうよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db9471ef2f854d91944aa276e2e7891cf1e3ae03633a34488b00c759792c509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:003bf0928bfaa3ce834c0ea1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キミとの勝利をっ！\r\nここに誓いまぁす！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f632997c00dcc55db86cc59ae77eb443ccc14cd631bfffadda6cda674440b26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce231a82332afaf00837583",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利を宣誓！\r\nウイニングチケットだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b8407794ce7b7e2136e5f245bb889853f1ce9205f1853214905d2f19768325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:422a7b2df183d9369d15f4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大闹一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0562b667bd7a6654fca33d90a2d0eba13d0af30b6ed6ac92c9648f06a577fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7685f369e05d3b2837d3339b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还没放弃理解我呢。\r\n虽然不觉得我和你会是什么志同道合的同志，\r\n但是就执着这一点，我们还是蛮像的啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "11aed43c68bce8a0421b6cc31283fca86e7590cd24867364fa38a645d0a6a76e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb3f31f28e4b595c92fd16a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f06e9d5d4b590fa75db11b1c2431f76a413069b4adaae557632a142ae95ad45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e573eca9cc760e38f24af4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab0a1b5f264b8e2d101da65558c524d614162055e28e3a65b2adcfc9f9d22001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f683bd3457b5dfc2a0970e78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在定义了你这个变量的那一刻开始，\r\n不管我愿不愿意，代码也随之发生了变化。\r\n那么，究竟最终结果会如何呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbb732eccdf8f79c104d48b44126e3c1063b7b797b4fbbc5bbf9770c730853d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9972a4c158d9b5a1d5464940",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……适应能力啥的还真麻烦啊。\r\n我居然也开始慢慢习惯你那些，\r\n不符合逻辑的行动了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b641abc69b2dfb719e24bc8ab9ccf018054c84d184cb1ded8386ea87dd857c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2fbb321ec792bc2d24675d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是正月假期？\r\n你没睡迷糊吧，\r\n这可是乘机领先的好机会啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "659431657568dc489d96e49fcc0f94855e56bb76f84e2b97690491de16638b84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab17eafa594869f11121d402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力？\r\n反正是高可可含量的，你想要的话就做给你吃吧。\r\n哈，吃的时候可别苦着个脸哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "012f27a8d454d4be6efd578e72f8836bbcd9b8d59625ab5bbf689b088e3b17e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06cf2a752b040c6dbbe0ca45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员室。桌子上。\r\n记得去看看。\r\n只要摄取了糖分，你就也能稍微有逻辑地思考一下了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4631eed1c5987aa016c241c4bf15ab05077b637c5f4d8603d87b9dfb365ed53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76d3816612cb05dc57f523af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想在七夕节许下的愿望？\r\n……我看起来像是会向谁祈祷的人吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cafeae34e82b7f5f65caf1774fe35c62a34eb79ce41d82aa0484472e0cd91ae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0f547fa37b9f360de9d46cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……喂，你可别跟我说什么“给我糖果”之类的蠢话哦？\r\n刚刚被速子缠上就已经让我很烦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "592d23835bdf269a48a723cf5d3757ce939dc3e8b5f87717e9156faad2c8c1de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4cffdfd0121bef8b68208f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "彩灯和圣诞歌曲……\r\n这个时候的街上净是噪音呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c0b573fd402a953993d7b603a9dfe3f9225a9d5878dc2af5311fd8fa1acf27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b705cac92e38b1d225c77fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要送我礼物？\r\n正好，我也想换些新的电脑配件了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c50a0e2a110654c9cd9b8f3ad7bca6f5a13b4823c3b8a6060395f73e1bdb42a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94905bddc16804b04ee55eb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理所当然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df8b1840a79f3894990111e73d2d38f4159afd7fdf22ef3a4cdb634385e8fd7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9428324332cb6fbf5fe8b0e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回老家？我才不回。\r\n这时候最适合窝在宿舍里敲代码。\r\n因为很安静所以很容易集中注意呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52dad013cc1c1aab5943c38a0285ea95e0074254f3b5853e4952b89cd893fff2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52798a744a0dfd358c2b35c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日吧。\r\n……笨蛋，就你的数据这种程度的东西，\r\n当然了若指掌了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b2a5c9ca4b7d7cee2efaa5a140456017242a23fda3c1c99db5b758b82b52883",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee1c8286cffe194d59d7f15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明是你重要的日子却还是来我这了啊……\r\n你还真是喜好独特呢。\r\n……那我就来祝贺你一下吧。恭喜了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "038b047de072dddb487559cb6cb825bf08af02ad39132bf1a210fbd3a7c560c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b542ce8c618f4a6896027a23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊？我的生日？\r\n训练员你居然连这种数据都记住了呀。\r\n还真是辛苦你了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5738a257e9ac5a0f8b0cd9251133fa7a286edadaf8ad216a3d72eb93bc298d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d5d41d6f9572707599f26e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……明明是我的生日，\r\n为什么反而是你这边在高兴啊……\r\n好好、谢谢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d1dd75998e85ffbd5a5557bf1f11ba92407074b5547749f0ef5535c7bb2c8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2563b8c6c251cc4a4f0add",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了呢。要确认一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c8d11a8f87e7c317b1097341e7307e4c34846629bac93740e052f26c517b9f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40d039969c867e8d585073b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物送到了哦？\r\n……可别做出“忘记拿了”之类的\r\n逊爆了的事哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c486297c7a0e924d1617aeecc0a1e2ea869b1b565652fc1ed44f1db3109f11a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3889d50699498635f486f7bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了啊。\r\n下次也要高效地完事哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd17a1cc015c88955e5607edb1285e05dd5cfe30bd60dd47c6bd10148967f869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d9f884d1456698e494c2cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像活动很快就要开始了啊。\r\n……切，这下又要吵闹起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ecba20799eb6abd84c7df36d78e953caff0f272e2283e13f22a85db7c91f9c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c06f3c154c1e4db573b7dd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中哦？\r\n参加还是不参加，都随你的便。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c8f67ef58d0ac8cd536224af6ce99ee886b91ff599a5820e9507ad43b92e33b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be60646693fc0b884ed8c5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "切，活该……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dbdea04a5a90b2ca293247ef5da623d677637e554c939e64f42759b9c7430a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:994ab9604591718bf7c5e455",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升了呢。\r\n去确认一下吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44cf7b94652f162ffd2af18c5d483d967803bc70388744cb6fc4f1f7f8c0d18c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1eaa9e6dbd6ea72ddc0ce08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耳カバーあるフーディーもあったが\r\n…グラフィックがな。…合理性？\r\nなァ、ファッションってわかるか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7f8dff630182e161fa91eac0cecb36df5bc9f767a499c13175ef4908c2bf53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71d840e3ed463ccc82f0b6bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ピアスな…入学前はもっと開けてた\r\nけど…もう埋まってンじゃねェの？\r\n単なる気分だよ、気分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66670fe13488e925ef73ad6ceb4f9953c2c8cb1fee120ade9484039df35bd9b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd8e06a39d9a2ae63e25f473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服は基本オンライン。それなりに\r\n試行したから、ハズレも即わかる。\r\n…判定プログラムでも作って売るか",
      "source_fingerprint": "59a14fb70f0292a56ddadc90723150d6a21e4c91046bb0c6a456c8ec512c1ab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36e718d0564132eaa342cdb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种结果，真的存在吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3abbe394520401a5f991e6d25ae163bc618bfd74b7f139f2f05017b84eea5b88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a8a7e35e55aca3d58589939",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08564caef354816a1ac4cee115b99707d9adb78494d7857fa288494437b85c6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66fc5919157af12f6a52c0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "切，活该……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dbdea04a5a90b2ca293247ef5da623d677637e554c939e64f42759b9c7430a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f0f8caff5caa6bb5b561d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种结果，真的存在吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3abbe394520401a5f991e6d25ae163bc618bfd74b7f139f2f05017b84eea5b88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1816fda3a2e07b4044611ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcbd654253cda31579be70bdc2b04abee0d1e8f168c2ceb27d3c6da06d45bb6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
